/P 931 0 R
/S /Figure
/Alt (Schematic of the three stages involved in the disk method. They are as follows. Stage 1. Known precalculus formula. Volume of disk V = pi \(R^2\) w. Stage 2. Representative element. Delta V = pi \([R\(x_i\)]^2\) Delta x. Stage 3. New integration formula. Solid of revolution. V = pi int_a^b \([R\(x\)]^2\) d x.)
/Type /StructElem
/K [17]
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
